<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Bike - MTI - Tempo and Standing Starts</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

Warm up for 10 progressing from z1-z2
-
1x5min high cadence (95+) z3
-
2min recovery
-
5x20sec seated stomps. Start in big gear from a standstill and wind it up so you're sprinting (in the saddle, not out) in the last 5 sec.

RPE guide: 140% FTP -> RPE 8-9; 82% FTP -> RPE 5-6; 55% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="300" PowerLow="0.40" PowerHigh="0.50"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="300" Power="0.82" CadenceLow="105" CadenceHigh="115"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="120" Power="0.55"/>
    <IntervalsT Repeat="6" OnDuration="20" OnPower="1.40" CadenceLow="50" CadenceHigh="90" OffDuration="180" OffPower="0.55"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="180" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.40"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>